I finish my work in the office.
I come out of the building.
It is evening time.
Now the weather suddenly changes.
There is no sun outside now.
The bright sunshine vanishes.
I look at the sky.
There are dark clouds in the sky.
Thick dark clouds roll in.
Suddenly, a cool wind picks up.
Now it is not hot outside.
This cool wind feels very nice.
The people on the street also look up at the clouds.
I remember the weather forecast.
It will rain this evening.
That forecast is absolutely correct.
The rain will start soon.
I stand right there for a moment.
I wait for the rain.
